##################################
# Building the Android Toolchain #
##################################

Run the configure script, then make_android_toolchain script.

You need Android SDK and NDK to compile PariDroid from source.

###########################
# Documentation & Support #
###########################

Documentation for building/using PariDroid can be found on the project wiki: https://code.google.com/p/paridroid/w/list

Bug reports, feature requests and everything else should be emailed to: paridroid@gmail.com

